  "content_en": "The ring \"popped\" Gu Qi slapped the table hard, stood up and said threateningly, \"The dignified president of Nanhua City was published in the newspaper by his father to sever the relationship between father and son. If you can afford to embarrass this person, I will not force you to get married.\" This is a scandal that must not be exposed. He really cannot afford to embarrass this person. Gu Mo narrowed his eyes, looked at Gu Qi's slightly proud look, and took a deep breath. It seemed that his father was determined this time. If a man has thirty-one flowers, he doesn't know what his father thinks. It's like he won't be able to marry a wife after he is thirty years old, and when he is thirty, he will have a life-threatening talisman all over the world. Gu Mo said stubbornly, \"You want me to get married, okay? I'll buy a wife tomorrow. I heard that Vietnamese wives are cheap and obedient.\" \"Nonsense, why are you buying a Vietnamese wife? Find me a local wife.\" Gu Qi glared at him. It seems that this time Dad is ready to rush the ducks. Gu Mo is a little irritated. Now he just wants to work hard and is not ready to get married at all. And looking at the posture, it is estimated that he and the girl have not yet seen eye to eye, and they will be escorted to get married. Gu Mo also tried to persuade Gu Qi, \"Dad, I really don't want to get married. Give me two more years. I promise to find you a wife before I'm thirty-five.\" \"Thirty-five?\" Gu Qi's voice immediately soared, \"I don't know if I can live for another five years. You want me to die with my eyes open, right?\" Gu Mo was sulking in his heart, not wanting to give in just yet. After all, he is his son. Gu Qi didn't know what he was thinking. He sat on the sofa again and said, \"Son, if you don't choose by yourself, your father will arrange a marriage for you. Then you will find someone who is lame and blind. If you don't like it, I won't face it for the rest of my life. You won't be the one who will be tortured by then.\" Even if he wants a lame and blind person, his father really wants his wife crazy. Gu Mo walked towards the door without looking back. He couldn't finish the meal. He promised to find it, but only the devil knows whether he can find it or not. Gu Qi naturally knew that he had given in, and was secretly happy for a while. When Lu Qingyan came out of the kitchen, she saw her son leaving and hurriedly chased after him, \"Gu Mo, why are you leaving?\" \"Let him go, let him go.\" Gu Qi didn't care, his face was full of joy. He finally got rid of this kid. Many of his old cells had died. He had to eat two more pieces of meat tonight to replenish his body. \"You broke up on bad terms again?\" Lu Qingyan frowned and asked quickly. Gu Qi said proudly, \"The bastard agreed, but I know he only agreed on the surface and didn't care about it privately. We still have to take advantage of the victory to pursue it and win it in one fell swoop.\" If his son was born to him, then he would have a way to cure him. Lu Qingyan was just happy but then worried, \"What should I do?\" \"After my observation, there is a girl I quite like. She is an international student and has an outstanding temperament. I have already communicated with her parents and will directly take someone to her place tomorrow.\" Jiang is still old and spicy. Lu Qingyan gave him a thumbs up. Gu Qi took a sip of tea, with a trace of sadness on his brows, \"Humph, I know that Gu Mo still misses that woman in his heart, but that woman has already rejected his proposal, and it's been so long. Gu Mo still doesn't want to have a girlfriend. It's okay to continue. I can't let that woman delay my son for the rest of his life.\" \"Yeah, I don't know what's going on. Love is going well. Yes, I thought she could become our Gu family's wife, but I didn't expect that they broke up in the end and hurt Gu Mo.\" Gu Qi snorted, \"How can we, the Gu family, wait so long after being dumped? We must get married and let that woman see that Gu Mo can live a better life if he breaks up with her.\" In the bar, Gu Mo ordered a bottle of wine and sat alone in a private room, drinking wine gloomily. In fact, Gu Mo is not a drinker on weekdays. He only drinks when he is extremely irritable. Oh, marriage, this word was once so close to me, almost within reach. He relaxed and leaned on the sofa, the bitterness in his eyes flashed. He took out a ring from his pocket. It was shiny and very delicate. It was a women's ring. Although it had been three years, he still carried it with him. The more he looked, the more depressed he became. He lit a cigarette, took a long drag, and then threw the ring into the wine glass. Immediately, the wine filled the ring. If she had agreed at the beginning, their children would be almost in kindergarten now, where they would still be forced to get married every day. Ever since he was a child, he has always been successful no matter what he does. He can get almost anything he wants. Even his friends around him say he is so lucky. But in the end he was dumped, and he was beggingOn the wedding day, haha, now that I think about it, my heart still hurts. The bride is not her, and it doesn't matter who she marries to. He leaned over and fished out the ring. He returned to the office, took out a small box, put the ring in and closed the lid. It's been three years, maybe he really should let it go. In fact, the fact that his parents have been forcing marriage over the years has something to do with this matter. It's not that he doesn't know their worries, but it would be nice if feelings were really so easy to let go. Forget it, his parents are getting older, so he should not let them worry about him anymore. If they can be happy and relieved by getting married, then he should get married. And even if he never gets married in this life, she and she will never have the chance to be together. ..... \"Mianmian, you don't know, you became famous in the company just after you cut off Xiang Siyi. Many male compatriots asked me about you. No, someone invited us to sing K after get off work. Let's go.\" Si Mian lay on the table listlessly, \"No.\" \"Why? You're not my favorite. Are you singing karaoke? She didn't let go of the microphone as soon as she entered the KTV.\" \"That was before.\" Xia Xia walked over and saw her as if she was beaten. She couldn't help but worry, \"What's wrong with you? Your brother bullied you again.\" \"How is that possible?\" She was as good as a little white rabbit at home, and Su Song couldn't even get the chance to bully her.",
  "translated": true
}